  "description": "Operating Area: Turkey, Greece\n\nStep aboard Perla Del Mar 2 and discover a modern, light-filled gulet designed for effortless comfort on the water. Soft tones, spacious interiors and thoughtful craftsmanship create a warm and inviting atmosphere the moment you enter.\n\nWith a well-balanced layout that includes a Deluxe Master, a Master cabin, and a selection of VIP Double and VIP Twin cabins, Perla Del Mar 2 offers both privacy and generous living comfort for every guest. The open decks, stylish seating areas and friendly crew make it easy to settle into a relaxed rhythm throughout your holiday.\n\nWhether you're swimming in quiet bays, exploring coastal towns or simply enjoying the breeze under the shade of the awning, Perla Del Mar 2 offers a calm and unhurried experience, a place where time slows down and each day becomes its own memory.",
